 lam hlam)).tprod\n            (Saxl.spechtRep (Saxl.canonicalTableau lam hlam))),\n          Function.Injective F"}],"state":"available","unresolved_names":[]},"generation_id":"sha256:eb85d3603ec7254e8723f8292d2014fbb295087c537d4a9a7c22689061a82822","id":"l:UniversalTensorSquares","kind":"lean-preview","omissions":[],"pairings":{"f:205":{"alternatives":["pair:1cac6ad5a908e1c87df95e12","pair:d0d75ccb0247942ccd555e97"],"evidence":["pair:04392743b89735af1a205d4f"],"method":"weighted-lexical-overlap","reason":"A lexical navigation candidate, not a reviewed correspondence.","review_state":"unreviewed","source_associations":[],"state":"candidate-pairing","target":"r:Universal-Tensor-Squares-for-Symmetric-Groups-September-24-2026:cor:unipotent-squares","targets":["r:Universal-Tensor-Squares-for-Symmetric-Groups-September-24-2026:cor:unipotent-squares"]}},"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","source_roles":{"boundary":"The challenge states the task. Solution sources and reported checks are separate; a challenge placeholder is not a proof verdict.","configuration":{"detail":{"path":"lean/913bc3afc59e808136ed0efe.json","pointer":"/row/comparator"},"source":{"file":"lean/ComparatorChallenges/UniversalTensorSquares.json","line":null,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"sha256:52a762a75e761e8012f4834dbf64cd2c512d2b49dffb99f22aea0f85a0314e98","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/lean/ComparatorChallenges/UniversalTensorSquares.json"},"state":"available"},"reported_runs":{"path":"lean/913bc3afc59e808136ed0efe.json","pointer":"/reader/runs"},"solution_entry":{"detail":{"path":"lean/913bc3afc59e808136ed0efe.json","pointer":"/row/comparator"},"source":{"file":"lean/OAI/RepresentationTheory/UniversalSquare/Main.lean","line":null,"pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","sha256":"sha256:48ff11dd63f84833492f1964751856351ba3ae761568f8db2837a1